/* Short, substantive follow-ups to the approved stories. These are fictional
 * household experiences, not additional policy claims or gameplay conditions. */
(function(root){
  'use strict';
  const R=(a,b,c,d)=>[{zh:a,en:b},{zh:c,en:d}];
  const lines={
    '1-chen':R('食阁里有人会问我今天怎么迟了。在家吃得到早餐，和自己过去坐坐，对我不是一样的事。','At the hawker centre someone notices when I am late. Getting breakfast at home is different from going there myself.','女儿能帮我整理屋里，却不能每个下雨的早晨都过来。公共地方怎么走，也得一起考虑。','My daughter can help tidy my home, but she cannot come every rainy morning. Getting through the public spaces matters too.'),
    '1-lin':R('推车走到一半才发现有台阶，就得倒回去找另一条路。带着两个孩子，很难临时换方向。','Finding steps halfway through means turning the pushchair around to find another route. Changing direction is difficult with two children.','有时只差入口最后一点高差，前面整段方便的路就接不上了。','Sometimes one final level change at the entrance breaks an otherwise useful route.'),
    '1-rahman':R('走近路的人很快就到了，我们绕一圈才到。地图上的距离，跟膝盖实际要走的距离不一样。','People taking the shortcut arrive quickly; we have to go around. The distance on the map differs from what our knees must manage.','能在中途歇一下，我们就比较愿意出门，不会因为怕走不动而一直留在家。','A place to rest halfway makes us more willing to go out rather than stay home worrying about the walk.'),
    '1-kumar':R('如果要母亲在几个地方反复起身、换位置，家属陪着也很吃力。','Having Mother repeatedly get up and change position along the journey is tiring even when we accompany her.','从家门到接送地点是同一趟出行，她不会因为走出房门就突然变得方便了。','The front door and pickup point are parts of one journey. Leaving the flat does not make the rest easy.'),
    '1-students':R('受伤的同学来之前，我们只会告诉他在哪栋楼，没想过还要说明从哪个入口进。','Before our injured friend visited, we only gave him the block number. We never thought to explain which entrance he could use.','搬行李的时候，我们也会借用平缓的路线。保持那里畅通，其实也在方便自己。','We use the gentler route when moving luggage too. Keeping it clear helps us as well.'),
    '1-ali':R('白天能靠周围的人认路，夜里人少时，我更依赖灯光和清楚的指示。','In daytime the people around help me find my way. With fewer people at night, lighting and clear signs matter more.','不是只要有一盏灯就够了，转角和入口能不能辨认，走过一次才知道。','Having a lamp is not the whole answer. You notice unclear corners and entrances by walking through them.'),
    '2-rahman':R('搬小以后，收拾屋子也许轻松些，可常坐的那一角、相熟的邻居，都要重新安排。','A smaller home might be easier to manage, but our favourite corner and familiar neighbours would need a new place in our lives.','我们会先比较以后每个月怎么过，再决定要不要搬，不想只盯着眼前能拿到多少。','We want to compare our monthly life in the years ahead before deciding, rather than focus only on money available now.'),
    '2-lin':R('看房时孩子总先找自己的房间，我们还得看买完以后每个月的账。','The children look for their own room when we view flats; we also have to examine the monthly bills afterwards.','如果离家人更远，临时有事时就没那么容易互相照应，面积不能把这一点补回来。','Living farther from family makes helping each other harder. Extra floor area cannot replace that.'),
    '2-chen':R('我在这里知道怎么买菜、什么时候能见到熟人。换地方不只是重新摆一套家具。','Here I know where to shop and when I will see familiar people. Moving means more than rearranging furniture.','住处容易打理当然好，但有没有选择、是不是我自己愿意，也一样要紧。','An easier home to manage is useful, but having a choice and wanting it myself matter too.'),
    '2-kumar':R('母亲关心的是一天怎样过，不是资料封面写了哪个计划名称。','Mother cares about her day, rather than the programme name on a brochure.','有些支持由住房提供，有些还需要另外安排，我们得一项一项分清。','Some support comes with the housing and some must be arranged separately. We need to distinguish them.'),
    '2-students':R('我们付的租金，对房东是退休生活的一部分；她改变计划，也会影响我们什么时候要找房。','Our rent contributes to our landlord’s retirement. Changes in her plans affect when we need to look for another room.','如果能早点知道安排，我们就能一起比较租金和去学校的路，不必到了最后才四处问。','Earlier notice lets us compare rent and the journey to campus together, instead of searching at the last minute.'),
    '2-ali':R('轮班后再多转一次车，付出的不只是车钱，还少了一段能休息的时间。','Another transfer after a shift costs more than the fare; it takes away time to rest.','便宜的房间如果很难配合上班，我就要把这些隐藏的负担重新算进去。','If a cheaper room makes work difficult, I must include those less obvious costs.'),
    '3-rahman':R('有人愿意谈价，和最后能完成交易，是两道不同的关。我们原来没把这层不确定算进去。','Finding someone willing to discuss a price and completing an eligible transaction are separate steps. We had not allowed for that uncertainty.','希望问个案的人能听见我们已经试过什么，不要每次都从头叫我们把房子挂牌。','We hope an adviser will hear what we have already tried, rather than simply tell us to list the flat again.'),
    '3-chen':R('平日里我认得的是会一起坐电梯、买早餐的人，不是一张分类表。','The neighbours I know are people I share lifts and breakfast routines with, rather than entries on a classification chart.','公共理由可以说明白，可受影响的人也得有地方讲自己的处境。','The public purpose can be explained while affected people also have a place to describe their circumstances.'),
    '3-lin':R('离祖母近一点能方便照看孩子，可一套房是否适合买，还得核对具体条件。','Being closer to Grandma could help with the children, but we still need to check the conditions for buying a particular flat.','我们不想因为一句传言，就把本来可以认真了解的选择先排除了。','We do not want a rumour to rule out an option before we have properly checked it.'),
    '3-kumar':R('同一个姓名背后，也可能有很不一样的家庭安排。先问本人，比替我们猜来得可靠。','People with similar names can have very different family arrangements. Asking us is more reliable than guessing.','我们可以私下核对需要的资料，不必为了纠正一句误会，把家里的事全说给邻居听。','We can check the necessary details privately without sharing every family matter to correct a neighbour’s assumption.'),
    '3-students':R('我们可以参加一件短期做得完的事，住得不久也不等于只能当旁观者。','We could help with something that can be finished in a short time. A short tenancy need not make us spectators.','后来的人可以接着用我们留下的资料，不必每批租户都从零开始认识这里。','The next tenants could use what we leave behind rather than learn everything from scratch.'),
    '3-ali':R('社区活动安排在我上班的时候，我知道大家热闹过，却很少真的在场。','Activities often happen while I am working. I hear about the gatherings without being there.','互相认识不一定每次都要办大活动，日常能遇见、能说上话，也会慢慢熟起来。','Getting acquainted need not require a big event every time. Everyday encounters and conversations count too.'),
    '4-chen':R('如果每一处都要先报名才能用，我只是临时下楼坐一下，就很难找到自己的位置。','If every space requires booking, it is hard to find a place when I simply come downstairs for a while.','留一点没有固定活动的地方，不代表那里没用，只是用法没写在活动表上。','An unprogrammed space is not unused; its uses just do not appear on an activity timetable.'),
    '4-lin':R('孩子不会一直停在现在这个年龄。今天合适的器材，过几年也得还有别的选择接上。','The children will not stay this age. Equipment that suits them today should be followed by other choices as they grow.','如果附近已经有同一种设施，我们宁愿这次补上缺少的用途，而不是再摆一套相同的。','If the same equipment already exists nearby, we would rather fill a missing use than add another identical set.'),
    '4-rahman':R('住得近的人方便，住得远一点的人可能就少用。讨论投入时，也应该让这些差别看得见。','People living nearer may use it more. Those differences should be visible when spending is discussed.','公共钱不需要每栋楼都换成一模一样的东西，但优先的理由要能讲给大家听。','Public funding need not buy identical things for every block, but the priorities should be understandable.'),
    '4-kumar':R('我们替母亲担心孤单，她却更在意能不能自己决定坐多久。家属和本人看重的不完全一样。','We worry about Mother being lonely; she values deciding how long to stay herself. Our priorities are not identical.','没有来说明会的人，也可能天天用这些地方。不能把缺席直接算成没有意见。','Someone missing a meeting may use the space every day. Absence does not mean having no view.'),
    '4-students':R('一张可以移动的桌子，做作业、展示东西和小组讨论时能有不同用法。','A movable table could serve assignments, displays and group discussions in different ways.','如果整片都装上固定器材，后来想换一种活动，也很难临时调整。','Filling the whole area with fixed equipment makes it difficult to adapt to a different activity later.'),
    '4-ali':R('同时关掉几个公共地方，影响会叠在一起；分开施工，生活至少还有别的选择。','Closing several public places at once compounds the disruption. Phasing leaves some alternatives available.','我愿意提前调整安排，但要先知道哪一段时间会影响哪些用途。','I can adjust my routine in advance if I know which uses are affected and when.'),
    '5-lin':R('孩子放学后才有空，不能只拿早晨有阴影的照片，来说明下午也能舒服地玩。','The children are free after school. A photograph of morning shade cannot show that afternoon play will be comfortable.','我们愿意听树丛为什么重要，也希望保留以后，活动场最热的时候能有实际替代。','We will listen to why the vegetation matters, while wanting a practical alternative at the hottest play time.'),
    '5-chen':R('我想在屋里舒服，也想下楼见人，不能只用其中一处的改善代表整天的生活。','I want comfort at home and the chance to see people downstairs. Improving one place does not cover my whole day.','座位晒着的时候，旁边有没有一小片能停留的阴影，就会影响我愿不愿意留下来。','When a seat is in the sun, nearby shade can decide whether I stay.'),
    '5-rahman':R('说愿意种菜，和每周都能来浇水，是两回事；不能等植物种下去以后才找人管。','Wanting to grow vegetables differs from being available to water them every week. Care needs arranging before planting.','公共花园也该有不领菜圃的人能用的地方，不是只有参与种植才算欢迎。','A public garden should welcome people without a growing plot too.'),
    '5-kumar':R('母亲坐下以后看得到什么、陪她的人坐在哪里，都影响她愿不愿意停留。','What Mother can see when seated and where her companion sits influence whether she wants to stay.','植物可以有不同层次，供人停留的地方也要留出来，不能只比较哪一种看着更整齐。','Layered planting and space for people can both matter. Neatness alone is not enough to compare designs.'),
    '5-students':R('我们看到过鸟和昆虫，但观察几次还不能替专业人员判断整片地方的价值。','We have seen birds and insects, but a few observations cannot establish the site’s ecological value.','保留树丛和让孩子舒服活动，都得看具体位置，不能只把两边的愿望各写一句。','Keeping vegetation and making play comfortable both depend on location, rather than listing two wishes.'),
    '5-ali':R('如果大家都挤进同一个冷气房，有空位的人舒服了，其他时段和屋外的问题仍然在。','A single crowded air-conditioned room helps those who get a place but leaves other times and outdoor conditions unresolved.','开放时间、容量和耗电也会连在一起，增加一个室内选择以后，还得看它怎样运行。','Hours, capacity and electricity use are connected. An extra indoor option still needs an operating plan.'),
    '6-students':R('走廊灯、水泵和电梯每天都要用电，公共部分省下来也有意义，只是不能和我们的账单混为一谈。','Corridor lights, pumps and lifts use electricity daily. Savings there matter, but they are different from our personal bills.','我们想看清楚项目实际服务哪里，而不是只看屋顶装了多少块板。','We want to understand what the installation serves, beyond counting panels on the roof.'),
    '6-lin':R('孩子看见水箱就以为家里也能用，我们得先把清洗、浇灌和饮用分开解释。','The children see a tank and assume the water can be used at home. We first need to distinguish cleaning, irrigation and drinking.','有没有人维护、平时怎样用水，和设备装好一样要紧。','Maintenance and everyday water use matter as much as installing equipment.'),
    '6-rahman':R('正常感应变暗与真正坏灯，看起来可能很像；知道差别以后，报修才不会找错问题。','Normal dimming and a faulty light can look similar. Knowing the difference helps us report the right problem.','人走近时能不能及时看清楚，比整晚亮得一样更贴近日常使用。','Being able to see clearly when approaching matters more than identical brightness all night.'),
    '6-kumar':R('电梯更省电，我们支持；但母亲安排出门时，仍要知道检修和停用的消息。','We support a more efficient lift, while still needing maintenance and shutdown information when planning Mother’s outings.','省下电量的数字不能代替日常运行可靠，施工和后续维护也得有人衔接。','Energy savings do not replace reliable operation. Installation and continued maintenance need coordinating too.'),
    '6-chen':R('旧收音机放错箱子，对来收的人也会添麻烦，标识最好能让我看懂具体收什么。','Putting an old radio in the wrong bin troubles the collectors too. The signs should clearly show accepted items.','有的东西我能自己拿下楼，有的就得找合适渠道，不能只说旧物都拿去回收。','I can carry some items downstairs myself; others need an appropriate collection route. Old items do not all belong in one bin.'),
    '6-ali':R('我不驾驶，也天天在这片公共空间里出行；只讨论充电位，会漏掉我们怎么接上公共交通。','I do not drive, but I travel through these common spaces daily. Discussing only chargers misses our connections to public transport.','可以把不同方式放在一起比较，看看谁已经方便、谁还缺一段支持。','We can compare different modes and see who is already well served and who still needs support.'),
    '7-lin':R('房子什么时候能住进去，和最后能提供多少套一样，都会影响家庭怎样作打算。','When homes become available affects families’ plans as much as the eventual number provided.','保留环境的理由我们愿意听，也希望知道减少的供给怎样承接，而不是只把图画小。','We will listen to conservation reasons while asking how reduced supply will be addressed, rather than merely shrinking a drawing.'),
    '7-students':R('我们开始工作以后，住房问题不再只是课堂上讨论的题目，也会进入自己的预算。','Since starting work, housing has become part of our own budget rather than just a classroom discussion.','愿意保留自然，也要认真面对住房时间和其他地点的限制；不能把困难移到图外就当解决了。','Supporting nature also means facing housing timing and other sites’ constraints. Moving a difficulty off the map does not solve it.'),
    '7-chen':R('新设施看起来漂亮，旧地方日常的清洁和维护却不能停，两边都是正在生活的人。','New facilities may look attractive, but daily cleaning and maintenance of older places must continue. People live in both.','熟悉的活动为什么有人继续来，先听使用的人说，才知道哪些东西值得接着留。','Listening to users explains why familiar activities continue to draw people and what is worth retaining.'),
    '7-rahman':R('另一处地方现在做什么、什么时候能腾出来，都会影响所谓替代方案是不是真的能用。','Existing uses and availability dates affect whether another site is a practical alternative.','如果原来使用那片地方的人也要调整，安排里同样得说明他们怎么办。','If the present users must adjust too, the plan should explain what happens to them.'),
    '7-kumar':R('住进去的人增加以后，原有家庭也还在使用服务，要把两边的需要一起算。','New residents will join existing families using services, so both groups’ needs must be considered.','先建房、以后再想服务，可能把等待留给住户；哪些配套要先到位，应该提前比较。','Building homes before considering services can leave residents waiting. The necessary timing of facilities should be compared early.'),
    '7-ali':R('建好那天是一件事，几年以后还能不能正常使用，是另一段需要持续投入的工作。','Completion day is one event; keeping things working years later takes continuing effort.','如果各种绿色设施分别交给不同的人管，交接时有哪些地方容易漏掉，也要看清楚。','With different people responsible for different green systems, the handover gaps need examining too.')
  };
  const renewal={zh:'上次租约快到期时，我们一边找房一边和房东谈。后来谈妥续租，大家才又留下来，暂时不用搬了。',en:'When the lease was close to ending, we looked for rooms while talking to the landlord. We eventually agreed on a renewal, so we stayed and do not need to move for now.'};
  function leaseContinuation(s,id){
    if(id!=='students'||!s||s.year<2)return null;
    for(let y=s.year-1;y>=1;y--){const plan=s.visitPlans?.['y'+y],reason=root.CM_YEAR_CONTENT?.refusals?.students?.[plan?.reasons?.students];
      if(!plan?.seen?.students||plan.accepted?.includes('students')||!/租约.*(?:到期|搬走)/.test(reason?.short?.zh||''))continue;
      if((s.caseTalks||[]).some(r=>r.residentId==='students'&&r.year>y&&r.year<s.year&&r.exchanges?.length))return null;
      return renewal;
    }return null;
  }
  root.CM_YEAR_POLICY_DIALOGUE={get:(year,id)=>lines[year+'-'+id]||[],leaseContinuation};
})(typeof window!=='undefined'?window:globalThis);
